g over. What's with that outfit and the cannon sleigh?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","014","resentful",null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Why else? Because somebody decided to betray me!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Oh, that's terrible—who's the scoundrel? I'll avenge you—==W==oh wait, that's me! Sorry!",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","006","happy",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_158","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Ugh, even now you're being mean to me...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_158","a",null,"vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.75],["say","avg1_158","I... I just hate this kind of physical work.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["stg",0,null,100.0,1.2,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_side_158_002",0,null,null],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","That sleigh is the one used for delivering gifts during the Snowish Festival, right?==W== So your \"physical work\" is pulling that thing?",1,""],["w",0.75],["mrt",0,"y","020","speechless",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.5,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["objx"],["w",0.85],["ctl","avg1_158","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg1_158","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_158","a",null,"attention",null,null,null,null,"jushou1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","The idea you came up with—the one about using a cannon to deliver gifts—I turned it into a proposal and submitted it. And the higher-ups immediately built a prototype.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","013","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Then they started talking nonsense like, \"If this works, we can use it for othe